    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Rules_36">
      <bpmn:text>Validation rules
Create/update: required profile, valid email and unique login email.
Create only: initial password meeting supported policy.
Update/deactivate: existing Staff target and current record version.
Only allowed Staff data; no Owner promotion.
No account changes on invalid/stale input.
Original creating administrator is preserved.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_Rules_36" sourceRef="Check_36" targetRef="Rules_36" associationDirection="None" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="RoleRules_36">
      <bpmn:text>Staff access (FR-STAFF-04–06)
Active: authorized operations only, including recording preparing-owner choices/percentages.
No allocated sales, costs, profit, financial analytics, pricing or customer management.
Inactive: deny Staff interface/protected actions, including existing sessions.
Acting Staff never gains an Owner share.
BPMN-26 enforces actual sign-in/access; not invoked again here.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_RoleRules_36" sourceRef="Show_36" targetRef="RoleRules_36" associationDirection="None" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Creator_36">
      <bpmn:text>Account creation safeguard
Associate new Staff account with the authenticated creating administrator.
Secure password storage; no plaintext logs.
Recheck permission/uniqueness at save.
Profile edits retain creator and role.
No customer registration (BPMN-27), invitation or external notification flow.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_Creator_36" sourceRef="Create_36" targetRef="Creator_36" associationDirection="None" />
  </bpmn:process>
